{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.WtraceRadicalTwoRow","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WtraceRadicalTwoRow","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuTraceNotFaithful"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WtraceRadicalTwoRow.exists_nonzero_orthogonal_of_twoRow_blocks_vanish","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WtraceRadicalTwoRow.exists_nonzero_orthogonal_of_twoRow_blocks_vanish","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/WtraceRadicalTwoRow.lean#L112-L120","doc":"The same statement in the form `OcneanuTraceNotFaithful` used at `n = 2`:\na **nonzero** such element refutes faithfulness of the form at level `n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.WtraceRadicalTwoRow.mem_rad_of_twoRow_blocks_vanish","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.WtraceRadicalTwoRow.mem_rad_of_twoRow_blocks_vanish","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/WtraceRadicalTwoRow.lean#L88-L110","doc":"**⊇ : the three-row part is invisible to `wtrace`.**\n\nAnything annihilated by every at-most-two-row block is in the radical of the\nOcneanu trace form — at every level, not just at `n = 2`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}